OL,3,GNEWSAOrchestra helps man with autism
OL,4,Afeel he belongs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trumpet player says an accessible
OL,7,Forchestra has helped him communicate
OL,8,Fthrough a new language and feel that he
OL,9,Fbelongs to a "wonderful community".
OL,11,FCameron Jacobs, from Salisbury in
OL,12,FWiltshire, who has autism, ADHD and
OL,13,FTourette's, said joining Orchestras for
OL,14,FAll seven years ago helped him feel
OL,15,Fpart of a club when many others
OL,16,Frejected him.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
