OL,3,GNEWSAOrchestra helps man with autism
OL,4,Afeel he belongs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 20-year-old, an ambassador for the
OL,7,Forchestra, has grown in confidence and
OL,8,Fhas since achieved many other feats,
OL,9,Fincluding breaking a world record for
OL,10,Fbeing the youngest person to run a
OL,11,Fmarathon barefoot.
OL,13,FJacobs said: "I feel like music is
OL,14,Fanother language. It feels like you are
OL,15,Fspeaking to people in the audience."
